</div>
</section>
<!-- CHAPTER 12 -->
<section class="chapter" id="chapter-12">
<h2>12. Hybrid Applications</h2>
<p>
                        A hybrid application combines web
                        technologies with mobile application
                        features through a supported framework
                        or runtime.
                    </p>
<h3>Advantages</h3>
<ol>
<li>Code reuse across platforms</li>
<li>Fewer separate codebases</li>
<li>Uses familiar web development skills</li>
<li>Can access some device features through plugins</li>
</ol>
<h3>Limitations</h3>
<ul>
<li>Performance varies by framework.</li>
<li>Advanced hardware access may need additional work.</li>
<li>Interfaces may need platform-specific adjustments.</li>
</ul>
<div class="example-box">
<strong>Example:</strong>
